    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classPlayer" kindref="compound">Player</ref> class is an abstract base class for different types of players. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class defines the common interface for all participants in the Tic-Tac-Toe game, whether they are human players (<ref refid="classHumanPlayer" kindref="compound">HumanPlayer</ref>), AI agents (<ref refid="classMiniMaxAgent" kindref="compound">MiniMaxAgent</ref>), or network players. It provides the mechanism to start the turn (<computeroutput><ref refid="classPlayer_1af85db5d05b014bf19d873038c56dc7ed" kindref="member">play()</ref></computeroutput>) and notify the completed move. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
